            [WARNING] On Jan 18, 2019 this sequence was replaced by
            NC_009552.3.
            
            On Oct 17, 2007 this sequence version replaced NC_009552.1.
            Several coding regions were added based on the existence of similar
            regions in other phages or the detection of a ribosomal binding
            site.  In addition, 255 nts were transposed from the 3' end of the
            genome to the 5' end in order to annotate a split gene with strong
            homology to an endonuclease.
