                     /note="p3a; essential for viral movement; Non-AUG
                     initiation (ACG initiation); non-AUG codon is translated
                     by initiator-tRNA-Met giving N-terminal Met. ORF3a in
                     Luteovirus and Polerovirus genera was predicted by
                     statistical analysis of sequence variation in large set of
                     aligned sequences. Functional analysis of protein 3a was
                     conducted with Turnip yellows virus. ORF3a was translated
                     in vitro, and confirmed by immunological assay in infected
                     protoplasts and in agroinoculated plants. Mutations that
                     prevent expression of protein 3a prevent virus systemic
                     infection (long-distance movement in plants). PMID
                     25946037"
