            [WARNING] On Apr 6, 2022 this sequence was replaced by
            NW_015148966.2.
            The DNA sequence is composed of genomic sequence, primarily
            finished clones that were sequenced as part of the Human Genome
            Project. PCR products and WGS shotgun sequence have been added
            where necessary to fill gaps or correct errors. All such additions
            are manually curated by GRC staff. For more information see:
            https://genomereference.org.
            This sequence will be incorporated into the reference assembly in
            the next major assembly release. At that time, the accession number
            for this patch will be made secondary to the reference chromosome
            accession. This scaffold adds finished component AC256300.1 to the
            reference assembly, replacing AC239832.3 and improving the
            representation of the tandem repeat in MUC2 (GeneID: 4583). It also
            replaces GRCh38 WGS components KF455302.1 and AUXG01000101.1 and
            draft sequence FP326773.16.
            
